' v1.2's set-aside strip at the trader (`temporarySpace`; `preset classic ai
' none seed 3 start 0`, New Sandez). A right click sets the bottle aside;
' EXIT clears only the exchange grids and the next visit clears the strip
' (`TraderScene.cs:230, 284-290`): the bottle is in no pack, on no ground and
' in no save. Back at the trader the strip is empty.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 224,305         ' the trader: film_05
wait 120
press space              ' the film closed: the trader
wait 10
rsceneclick 88,119       ' the bottle aside
wait 3
snap set_aside
esc                      ' leave: the bottle is lost
wait 10
save
mapclick 224,305         ' back
wait 120
press space
wait 10
snap strip_empty
esc
quit
